# jevcache

When making OpenAI-compatible chat completion calls in this project, use:

- `baseURL`: `http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1`
- API key: `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` or `UPSTREAM_API_KEY` from `.env`

Assume jevcache is running locally (`npx --yes github:kushals256/jevcache` or Docker). Do not commit `.env`. Tool-calling and streaming may bypass the cache by design.
